  "description": "A story of two individuals who have always felt better off alone. Hardworking, friendly, but harboring a side she doesn’t like to show, Jihyun Kang aspires to be a director. Shy, reserved, but full of love and passion, Chanyoung Kwon aspires to be a screenwriter. The two college students cross paths, and together they learn what it means to love and be loved as they navigate their lives trying to make it in the entertainment industry.\n\n- Webtoons",
